### Checklist

Estimated Effort
Estimated Days: 1

| Task                                             | Target Hours   |
|--------------------------------------------------|----------------|
| Define interface (I<#= Model.Name #>)            | 0.5h           |
| Behavioural partial class (+ constructor events) | 1.0h           |
| State partial class (private setters)            | 0.5h           |
| Domain events (created/other)                    | 0.5h           |
| EF configuration                                 | 0.5h           |
| DbContext registration                           | 0.25h          |
| Repository interface + implementation            | 1.0h           |
| DI registration                                  | 0.25h          |
| Multi-tenant adaptation (opt)                    | 0.5h           |
| Soft delete adaptation (opt)                     | 0.5h           |
| Documentation updates                            | 0.5h           |
| Buffer                                           | 0.5h           |
| Total Target Hours                               | 6.0h (≈ 1 day) |

Acceptance Checklist
- [ ] Interface I<#= Model.Name #> defined
- [ ] Behaviour partial (<#= Model.Name #>.cs) implements invariants + raises events
- [ ] State partial (<#= Model.Name #>State.cs) contains persistence shape only
- [ ] Domain events created or updated as required
- [ ] EF configuration ignores DomainEvents and enforces schema
- [ ] DbContext updated with DbSet + ApplyConfiguration
- [ ] Repository interface + implementation returning abstractions
- [ ] DI registration added
- [ ] Multi-tenant handling N/A or implemented
- [ ] Soft delete handling N/A or implemented
- [ ] Validation approach for behaviour/persistence captured (automated or manual)
- [ ] Documentation updated (this recipe referenced)
- [ ] Effort variance >20% noted

<#+
string GetTypeName(ITypeReference tr)
{
    var name = tr.Element.Name;
    if (tr.IsCollection) name += " []";
    return name;
}
#>